config SCOPE_CAPTURE_HW
	bool "Capture with the FPGA's scope_capture"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_HVHDL_SCOPE_CAPTURE_ENABLED
	help
	  The scope_capture block of ti60_ac_psu's tsemac_soc design, its deep
	  capture written into a ring in this RAM by a DMA channel. Without it
	  the captures come from a software model of its test generator.

config SCOPE_RING_RECORDS
	int "Records in the capture ring"
	default 1048576
	depends on SCOPE_CAPTURE_HW
	help
	  A record is a sample of all eight channels, 16 bytes. A power of two. The ring is on
	  the HyperRAM's second die (16 MB), shared with the stream's.

config SCOPE_STREAM
	bool "Stream the FPGA's continuous capture on a WebSocket of its own"
	default y
	depends on SCOPE_CAPTURE_HW
	select TCP_STREAM
	select TCP_STREAM_WEBSOCKET
	help
	  Port 5004 (stream.c): sent from the capture ring by tcp_stream beside
	  the network stack, as fast as the link takes it.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
